    "representation": "lean4-declaration",
    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem erdos_289 : answer(sorry) ↔\n    (∀ᶠ k : ℕ in atTop, ∃ I : Fin k → ℕ × ℕ,\n    (∀ i, (I i).1 < (I i).2) ∧\n    (∀ i j, i ≠ j → (I i).2 < (I j).1 ∨ (I j).2 < (I i).1) ∧\n    ∑ i, ∑ n ∈ .Icc (I i).1 (I i).2, (n⁻¹ : ℚ) = 1)",
